",\"title\":\"Film\"}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"ryrrgw-pools-director-qa-27th-aug-the-haggerston-london-tickets\",\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-08-27T19:30:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-08-27T19:30:00+01:00\",\"pre_sale_start_date\":null,\"event_end_date\":\"2026-08-27T22:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-31/7a286d2a-66b5-4232-b0f6-32a7ad91179c.jpg?rect=200%2C0%2C800%2C800\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-31/7a286d2a-66b5-4232-b0f6-32a7ad91179c.jpg?rect=0%2C40%2C1200%2C720\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-31/7a286d2a-66b5-4232-b0f6-32a7ad91179c.jpg?rect=380%2C0%2C440%2C800\"},\"announcement_date_unix\":1787007600,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"id\":\"6a855f935690ec0001a87ccb\",\"properties\":[],\"about\":{\"description\":\"Q&A with Writer/Director Sam Hayes,\\n\\nPOOLS dives into the chaotic life of Kennedy, a rebellious college student who has one day to get her life together or face expulsion. Rather than conform, she recruits a misfit crew for a spontaneous night of pool hopping through the lavish backyards of her college town. What starts as an adrenaline-fueled escape turns into something deeper as Kennedy confronts grief, identity, and the lingering impact of her father's death. It's messy, it's emotional, and it's the ride of her life.\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null},{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"donation\":null,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"date_unix\"