            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-14/c29dd6ed-2875-49ba-8cde-66b958a64056.jpg?rect=0%2C244%2C1536%2C1536\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-14/c29dd6ed-2875-49ba-8cde-66b958a64056.jpg?rect=0%2C687%2C1536%2C922\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-14/c29dd6ed-2875-49ba-8cde-66b958a64056.jpg?rect=137%2C0%2C1263%2C2296\"},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by After The Credits\",\"unicorn\":true,\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"multi_step_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"donation\":null,\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":2271,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"150577\",\"name\":\"After The Credits \",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"after-the-credits-gebe5\",\"profile_active\":false},\"marketeers\":[],\"max_tickets\":2,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"about\":{\"description\":\"Welcome to After The Credits! London’s newest film club, making cinema fun again :)\\n\\nJoin us at Showcase Cinema de Lux Bluewater for a special screening of The Great Gatsby with ATC.\\n\\nCome for the movie and stay for lively Q&As, interactive games, exciting surprises, and more. Grab your friends, settle in, and get ready for an unforgettable night of film, fun, and 1920s glamour. ✨🥂\\n\\nPLEASE NOTE: By attending, you give us permission to use any photos or videos featuring you on our social media pages. We may be taking photos and videos throughout the event! 📸😊\\n\\nDon’t forget to follow ATC on Instagram and TikTok: @afterthecreditsuk\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null},{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by After The Credits\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"name\":\"AFTER THE CREDITS SCREENS | The Great Gatsby \",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/l0e14a11c7c3?dice_id=l0e14a11c7c3\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Nf8d9f24042f?dice_id=Nf8d9f24042f\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Pa5fe738b741?dice_id=Pa5fe738b741\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/H7d6871d342d?dice_id=H7d6871d342d\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/f3793dd1e495?dice_id=f3793dd1e495\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/mb740981a25b?dice_id=mb740981a25b\"},\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"18545\",\"name\":\"Showcase Cinema de Lux Bluewater\",\"address\":\"Bluewater Parkway, Stone, Greenhithe, DA9 9SG, United Kingdom\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.43704449748793,\"lng\":0.27044676692519914},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"65d5e46008592c338080248a\",\"name\":\"Gravesend\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.442164806447025,\"lng\":0.3720925005915759,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"GB\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"showcase-cinema-de-lux-bluewater-eoq7y\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-08-28T19:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"announcement_date_unix\":1786730400,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"perm_name\":\"v3xd5l-after-the-credits-screens-the-great-gatsby-28th-aug-showcase-cinema-de-lux-bluewater-greenhithe-tickets\",\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-08-14T19:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-08-24T20:15:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-08-16T20:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-08-28T19:00:00+01:00\",\"pre_sale_start_date\":null,\"event_end_date\":\"2026-08-28T23:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"id\":\"6a7f070acd6a6a0001b9bc65\",\"properties\":[],\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"date_unix\":1787940000,\"offers_extras\":false,\"secondary_status\":null,\"previews\":[],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":131391,\"title\":\"IS THERE PARKING?\",\"body\":\"Parking is completely free at the shopping centre!\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":131392,\"title\":\"WHERE DO I GRAB SNACKS?\",\"body\":\"You’re able to purchase food & snacks on the counters at the cinema!\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":131393,\"title\":\"IS THERE A DRESS CODE?\",\"body\":\"Our dress code is casual! Please be comfortable but at the same time come picture ready… that makes sense, right?\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":131394,\"title\":\"TERMS & CONDITIONS 1\",\"body\":\"By purchasing or reserving a ticket, you agree to the following Terms & Conditions:\\n\\n1\\\\. Tickets\\n\\nAll tickets are subject to availability.\\n\\nTickets are valid only for the date, time and venue stated on the ticket.\\n\\nPlease bring your ticket (digital or printed) for admission.\\n\\n2\\\\. Admission\\n\\nDoors open approximately 30 minutes before the advertised start time.\\n\\nLate arrivals may be admitted at the discretion of the event organisers and may be required to wait until a suitable break in the screening.\\n\\nThe organisers reserve the right to refuse admission or remove any attendee whose behaviour is deemed disruptive, abusive, intoxicated or otherwise inappropriate. No refund will be issued in these circumstances.\\n\\n3\\\\. Seating\\n\\nSeating is unreserved unless otherwise stated and is available on a first-come, first-served basis.\\n\\nThe organisers reserve the right to adjust seating arrangements where necessary.\\n\\n4\\\\. Q&A Session\\n\\nA live Q&A session may take place following the screening.\\n\\nAudience members are welcome to ask questions, subject to the discretion of the event host or moderator.\\n\\nThe organisers reserve the right to decline, interrupt or remove questions that are offensive, inappropriate, defamatory, discriminatory, or unrelated to the event.\\n\\nThe opinions expressed by guest speakers or panellists are their own and do not necessarily reflect those of the organisers.\\n\\nThe advertised guests are subject to change without prior notice due to unforeseen circumstances.\\n\\n5\\\\. Raffle\\n\\nA raffle may be held during the event.\\n\\nEntry is available only to attendees present at the screening unless otherwise stated.\\n\\nWinners will be selected at random and announced during the event.\\n\\nPrizes are non-transferable, non-exchangeable and no cash alternative will be offered unless stated otherwise.\\n\\nIf a winner is not present when announced, the organisers reserve the right to redraw another winner.\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":131395,\"title\":\"TERMS & CONDITIONS 2\",\"body\":\"6\\\\. Refunds & Transfers\\n\\nTickets are non-refundable unless the event is cancelled or significantly rescheduled by the organisers.\\n\\nTickets may be transferred to another person if you are unable to attend, unless otherwise stated.\\n\\n7\\\\. Event Changes\\n\\nThe organisers reserve the right to amend the programme, schedule, venue, speakers or other event details where reasonably necessary.\\n\\nIn the event of cancellation, ticket holders will be contacted with further information regarding available options.\\n\\n8\\\\. Photography & Recording\\n\\nPhotography and video recording may take place during the event for promotional purposes.\\n\\nBy attending, you acknowledge that you may appear in photographs or recordings used by the organisers unless you notify a member of the event team before the event.\\n\\nRecording or photographing the film itself is strictly prohibited.\\n\\n9\\\\. Liability\\n\\nAttendance is at your own risk.\\n\\nThe organisers accept no responsibility for loss, theft or damage to personal belongings, except where required by applicable law.\\n\\n10\\\\. Accessibility\\n\\nIf you have any accessibility requirements, please contact the organisers before the event so that reasonable arrangements can be made where possible.\\n\\n11\\\\. Contact\\n\\nFor any questions regarding your booking or the event, please contact the organisers using the details provided on the ticketing page.\",\"order\":4}]}",
