          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"unicorn\":true,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Our Kino Short Film Fund offers:\\n\\n- 💷 up to £5000 to cover the costs of Production, Post-Production and/or Distribution\\n- 🎥 a camera and lens package\\n- 💡a lighting package courtesy of Matte Black\\n- 🤝 mentorship from an Oscar qualified producer\\n\\nIn Spring 2026, we supported ***SINS OF THE FLESH*** (which will premiere August 29th at 8:30pm during our ***Kino Kills*** screening block), a horror comedy from writer/director Max Ward and producer Will Butters.\\n\\nIn this session we’ll chat with Max and Will so you can find out what made their script rise above the competition and just how Kino supported the project in practice.\\n\\nThis is an 18+ event. This venue has a strict No ID, No entry Policy. Physical government photo ID required, we do not accept photos or copies of ID’s.\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by Kino Short Film.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"multi_step_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"298\",\"name\":\"Strongroom Bar\",\"address\":\"120-124 Curtain Rd, Shoreditch, London EC2A 3SQ, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5259644,\"lng\":-0.0801498},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2021-11-09/01c2cab5-15ea-48e0-a0b4-d9ed0465d9db.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C850%2C850\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"GB\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"strongroom-bar-4bym\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":null},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"capacity\",\"title\":\"300 capacity\"}],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-08-29T17:00:00+01:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"perm_name\":\"q2q2b9-kino-industry-session-a-kino-original-autopsy-29th-aug-strongroom-bar-london-tickets\",\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":1000,\"sales_tax\":0,\"amount_from\":null},\"max_tickets\":20,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"Kino Industry Session: A Kino Original Autopsy\",\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/I481e79f81bd?dice_id=I481e79f81bd\",\"post_competition_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T34a6e0e8d03?dice_id=T34a6e0e8d03\",\"post_purchase_extras_available_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/ke46bbe43451?dice_id=ke46bbe43451\",\"post_purchase_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/T9333f893445?dice_id=T9333f893445\",\"post_reminder_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/rac941b9447a?dice_id=rac941b9447a\",\"post_waitinglist_referral\":\"https://link.dice.fm/Qde836ca217e?dice_id=Qde836ca217e\"},\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"marketeers\":[],\"faqs\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}],\"seats_io_event_id\":null,\"announcement_date_unix\":1784365200,\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"seating\":null,\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-07-18T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-08-29T17:15:00+01:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-07-18T10:30:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-08-29T17:00:00+01:00\",\"pre_sale_start_date\":null,\"event_end_date\":\"2026-08-29T18:00:00+01:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-18/5c41bae1-ba3c-446f-9e33-cff67fb5b7cf.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1920%2C1920\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-18/5c41bae1-ba3c-446f-9e33-cff67fb5b7cf.jpg?rect=0%2C384%2C1920%2C1152\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-18/5c41bae1-ba3