          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"unicorn\":true,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**“THE ONLY REASON I'M HERE IS THEY PAID ME $5,000.”**\\n\\nSo begins Abel Ferrara's director's commentary for the gloriously filthy crime epic King of New York.\\n\\nWe're screening Ferrara's 1990 crime classic with his own director's commentary playing alongside the film — and what follows might be the most chaotic commentary track of all time.\\n\\nWatch Christopher Walken, Laurence Fishburne, Wesley Snipes and Steve Buscemi tear through the streets of early-'90s New York while Ferrara talks us through the madness.\\n\\nAbel Ferrara is having the time of his fucking life watching his own movie.\\n\\nHe's obsessed with Christopher Walken's hair.\\n\\nHe absolutely loses it whenever Steve Buscemi appears on screen.\\n\\nHe's in love with the women he cast in the movie.\\n\\nHe laughs, he shouts, he reacts to scenes like he's watching them for the first time.\\n\\nTwo hours inside Abel Ferrara's brain.\\n\\nCome watch one of the great New York movies in the possibly ill-advised way it was meant to be experienced.\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null},{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies. \",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"multi_step_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"2338\",\"name\":\"The Haggerston\",\"address\":\"438 Kingsland Rd, London E8 4AA, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.5423183,\"lng\":-0.0758063000000675},\"image\":null,\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"GB\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"per