ing for all ages.\\n\\n**Certificate: PG**\\n\\n**Running Time: 88 minutes**\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null},{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"presented_by\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"seats_io_public_key\":null,\"status\":\"on-sale\",\"date_unix\":1791716400,\"offers_extras\":false,\"secondary_status\":null}",
