          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"faqs\":[],\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"about\":{\"description\":\"Celebrate Halloween with one of the most beloved family films of all time Disney's Hocus Pocus (1993)\\n\\nWhen three curious kids accidentally resurrect the mischievous Sanderson sisters on Halloween night, they find themselves in a race against time to stop the legendary witches before sunrise.\\n\\nPacked with unforgettable performances, spooky fun, and endless quotable moments, Hocus Pocus has become a Halloween tradition for generations. Whether you're revisiting a childhood favourite or introducing it to a new generation, there's no better way to experience this magical classic than with an audience.\\n\\n**Certificate: PG**\\n\\n**Running Time: 96 minutes**\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"All ages\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null},{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by Deeper Into Movies.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1000},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"previews\":[],\"max_tickets\":6,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"name\":\"HOCUS POCUS  (FAMILY FILM SCREENING) \",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-02/b5685154-fc3b-4087-95d9-463bafa4f6a3.jpg?rect=0%2C200%2C2000%2C2000\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-02/b5685154-fc3b-4087-95d9-463bafa4f6a3.jpg?rect=0%2C600%2C2000%2C1200\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-02/b5685154-fc3b-4087-95d9-463bafa4f6a3.jpg?rect=340%2C0%2C1320%2C2400\"},\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"7425\",\"name\":\"Big Penny Social\",\"address\":\"1 Priestley Way, London E17 6AL, UK\",\"