          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"unicorn\":true,\"about\":{\"description\":\"**SUNDAY 20TH DECEMBER / DOORS & BARS OPEN 2.30PM / LIVE SHOW & MOVIE FROM 3.30PM / AGES 8+**\\n\\n**Get in the festive spirit with Kermit, Miss Piggy, Gonzo & Mr Dickens at our Christmas screening of The Muppets Christmas Carol! Come one, come all, come Christmas! 🎄🎬**\\n\\nOn top of screening the full movie on our huge cinema screen, we’ve got our festive-tastic performers leading sing-alongs & games to add an extra sprinkle of family fun💫 Plus no winter classic would be complete without the magic of real(ish) snow floating down over the auditorium from our huge snow machine ❄️ Fancy dress welcome & encouraged!\\n\\nIf you get hungry watching those Christmas feasts on screen, we’ve got you covered with mince pies, hot dogs, nachos, popcorn, chocolates and - of course - Miss Piggys in blankets 🐷 Our bar will stay open throughout serving mulled wine in addition to all our fabulous cocktails, beers & soft drinks 🍷\\n\\nThe Clapham Grand was a real cinema from 1930-1963 and watching a Christmas classic in our beautiful theatre really brings back that magical historical feel.\\n\\nAlso this is a special family friendly movie night, we welcome anyone from 8 - 108! Just no Scrooges… And anyone under 18 accompanied by an over 21.\\n\\n**Thank you. Thank you. Fifty times! And a merry Christmas.**\\n\\n*Our Christmas Movie Nights are like no other, alongside watching the movie uninterrupted on our massive (25 ft!) screen, we have a whole lot more in store for you before & after the film, including The Grand's live hosts & show team, mulled wine, mince pies, confetti, snow machines, the occasional balloon drop 🎈*\\n\\n*Feel free to sing-along, heckle the bad guys and cheer for your heroes, a costume is never un-appreciated (in fact we often give out prizes for the best or worst), the bar & food stalls stay open during the movie and sometimes afterwards there’s a club night to top things off!*\\n\\n**If you have any questions please scroll down to the FAQ section below.**\",\"one_liner\":null,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"age_restriction\",\"title\":\"This is an 18+ event\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null},{\"type\":\"promoter\",\"title\":\"Presented by The Clapham Grand.\",\"subtitle\":null,\"external_link\":null}]},\"summary_lineup\":{\"top_artists\":[],\"total_artists\":0,\"total_free_texts\":0},\"attendance_type\":\"live_only\",\"multi_step_extras\":false,\"tty_to_extras\":[],\"streaming_options\":null,\"shopping_cart_enabled\":true,\"venues\":[{\"id\":\"1061\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"address\":\"The Clapham Grand, 21-25 St John's Hill, London SW11 1TT, UK\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.4629923,\"lng\":-0.169368800000029},\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-07-03/e259969a-4ab9-4749-9fe1-18cf6d32bda9.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\"},\"city\":{\"id\":\"54d8a23438fe5d27d500001c\",\"name\":\"London\",\"location\":{\"lat\":51.507653,\"lng\":-0.107722,\"place\":\"Europe/London\"},\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_id\":\"GB\",\"country_name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-ry8v\",\"accessibility\":{\"url\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\"},\"profile_active\":true,\"highlights\":[{\"type\":\"accessibility\",\"title\":\"Accessibility information\",\"external_link\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\"}],\"space_name\":null,\"doors_open_date\":\"2026-12-12T14:30:00+00:00\",\"doors_close_date\":null}],\"price\":{\"currency\":\"GBP\",\"amount\":null,\"sales_tax\":null,\"amount_from\":1500},\"max_tickets\":12,\"public_refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"cooling_off_enabled\",\"hours\":24},\"images\":{\"square\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-07/5eaff518-aa14-4a34-ad92-0314f932a35d.jpg?rect=0%2C0%2C1080%2C1080\",\"landscape\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-07/5eaff518-aa14-4a34-ad92-0314f932a35d.jpg?rect=0%2C216%2C1080%2C648\",\"portrait\":\"https://dice-media.imgix.net/attachments/2026-08-07/5eaff518-aa14-4a34-ad92-0314f932a35d.jpg?rect=243%2C0%2C594%2C1080\"},\"name\":\"The Muppets Christmas Carol Movie Night\",\"is_hidden_event\":false,\"unicorn_extras\":true,\"acquisition_type\":\"purchase\",\"is_ticket_available_at_door\":false,\"announcement_date_unix\":1785834000,\"is_fully_locked\":false,\"tags_types\":[{\"name\":\"film\",\"value\":\"culture:film\",\"title\":\"Film\"}],\"faqs\":[{\"id\":48280,\"title\":\"What do I do if I have a question about the venue?\",\"body\":\"Check out all FAQs for attending shows on our website, here: https://claphamgrand.com/faqs/\\n\\nFor any further information about the show, timings, age restrictions or general questions please contact Team Grand on info@claphamgrand.com detailing your enquiry and the show/date in question and we’ll be happy to help\",\"order\":0},{\"id\":48281,\"title\":\"I have questions about access, where can I get the information I need?\",\"body\":\"Please note our Upstairs Bar is not wheelchair accessible & you will need to be able to take 8 flights of stairs to the 5th floor.\\n\\nYou can see our venue access info here - https://claphamgrand.com/accessibility/\\n\\nIf you require PA tickets or seat reservations for access reasons please contact us **prior** to purchasing your tickets to ensure we have availability and can meet your requirements. The best way to do this is by calling us on 020 7223 6523 or emailing access@claphamgrand.com & including your phone number in the email. Our office hours are 9am-5.30pm Mon – Sat\",\"order\":1},{\"id\":48284,\"title\":\"What can I expect in terms of flashing lights, loud noises and other similar elements?\",\"body\":\"Please note there may be strobes, flashing lights, loud noises, confetti, the occasional balloon drop and other fun stuff used in the venue. If you have any concerns about this don’t hesitate to contact us if you need any further assistance, we want to make sure you have a safe and enjoyable experience with us\",\"order\":2},{\"id\":48282,\"title\":\"I have already purchased my tickets & have questions about the tickets themselves\",\"body\":\"For any ticketing enquiries - for example where to find your tickets or about the Dice app please contact DICE via their Help Desk. If you still have questions after this, please email info@claphamgrand.com\",\"order\":3},{\"id\":48285,\"title\":\"What is 'unallocated' seating?\",\"body\":\"Most of our seated shows have unallocated seating, meaning seating is on a first come, first served basis in the area you have bought a ticket for (eg stalls/circle). We never sell more tickets than there are seats available - so if you've bought a ticket for a seat, you'll definitely get a seat, you just won't have a specific seat reserved.\",\"order\":4}],\"perm_name\":\"3ornbx-the-muppets-christmas-carol-movie-night-12th-dec-the-clapham-grand-london-tickets\",\"dates\":{\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"announcement_date\":\"2026-08-04T10:00:00+01:00\",\"sale_end_date\":\"2026-12-12T14:30:00+00:00\",\"sale_start_date\":\"2026-09-08T10:00:00+01:00\",\"event_start_date\":\"2026-12-12T14:30:00+00:00\",\"pre_sale_start_date\":null,\"event_end_date\":\"2026-12-12T18:30:00+00:00\",\"is_multi_days_event\":false},\"marketeers\":[{\"id\":12,\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"privacy_policy_link\":\"https://claphamgrand.com/privacy-policy/\",\"fb_pixel_id\":\"1705644923004016\",\"ga_tracking_id\":\"UA-5134978-1\",\"tiktok_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_checkout_initiated_pixel_id\":null,\"twitter_purchase_pixel_id\":null,\"google_ads_conversion_id\":null,\"google_ads_purchase_conversion_label\":null,\"show_web_opt_in_form\":true,\"show_opt_in_form\":true,\"opt_out_as_default\":false}],\"billing_promoter\":{\"id\":\"399\",\"name\":\"The Clapham Grand\",\"image\":{\"url\":null},\"perm_name\":\"the-clapham-grand-zl9b\",\"profile_active\":false},\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"social_links\":{\"event_share\":\"https://link.dice.fm/